      "description": "Four simulated real workspaces (4.2 m L × 3.3 m W × 3.0 m H, ~14 m² area) were created: 1. Control group (no biophilic design). 2. Green wall group (1 m² green wall with potted plants, representing 'visual connection with nature'). 3. Wood group (3.6 m L × 3.0 m H wooden wall, representing 'material connection with nature'). 4. Combination group (green wall overlapping wooden wall). All spaces had artificial lighting (950 lx), ventilation, quiet, temperature 24.8 ± 0.9 °C, humidity 43.9 ± 6.4%. Plants emitted no distinct odors.",
